The Climate Action and Resilience Committee (CARC) https://www.winnipeg.ca/city-governance/boards-commissions/climate-action-and-resilience-committee initiated this poll through Probe Research Inc. The survey results share Winnipeggers’ perspectives on:
•	level of concern about climate change and its impact on City services;
•	familiarity and level of satisfaction with what the City is doing on climate change;
•	priority actions among City services, and; 
•	experiences with impacts of climate change.

Supporting documents:
•	CARC Motion October 28, 2024: http://clkapps.winnipeg.ca/DMIS/permalink.asp?id=A20241028(RM)CAR-10
•	Council Motion: Results Recommendation- May 22, 2025: http://clkapps.winnipeg.ca/DMIS/permalink.asp?id=A20250522(RM)C-88
•	Key Findings Summary: http://clkapps.winnipeg.ca/DMIS/permalink.asp?id=A20250522(RM)C-89
•	Questionnaire and Results Tables: http://clkapps.winnipeg.ca/DMIS/permalink.asp?id=A20250522(RM)C-90
